			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 700670101,
					"content": "这里是哪里啊？这应该算是结束了吧？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700670102
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 700670102,
					"content": "没错，结束了。大家都恢复了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700670103
					],
					"speakerTitle": "维特鲁威"
				},
				{
					"id": 700670103,
					"content": "……",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700670104
					],
					"speakerTitle": "柯莎玛"
				},
				{
					"id": 700670104,
					"content": "……",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700670105
					],
					"speakerTitle": "维尼皮"
				},
				{
					"id": 700670105,
					"content": "怎么了，咬着嘴巴的。看到我太感动了忍不住要哭了吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700670106
					],
					"speakerTitle": "维特鲁威"
				},
				{
					"id": 700670106,
					"content": "呵呵哈哈哈哈哈哈！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700670107
					],
					"speakerTitle": "柯莎玛"
				},
				{
					"id": 700670107,
					"content": "哈哈哈哈…柯…莎玛，你不能，不能笑啊。这不、这不露馅了吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700670108
					],
					"speakerTitle": "维尼皮"
				},
				{
					"id": 700670108,
					"content": "你们笑得再大声，我也只是有一点尴尬而已。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700670109
					],
					"speakerTitle": "维特鲁威"
				},
				{
					"id": 700670109,
					"content": "爱是命运，死也亦然。爱与死没什么好笑的！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700670110
					],
					"speakerTitle": "维特鲁威"
				},
				{
					"id": 700670110,
					"content": "不笑了不笑了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700670111
					],
					"speakerTitle": "维尼皮"
				},
				{
					"id": 700670111,
					"content": "对了，彩特琳德呢？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700670112
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 700670112,
					"content": "我也不知道。我就在门外，被复原的大家也是。他们刚才还在拥抱呢。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700670113
					],
					"speakerTitle": "维特鲁威"
				},
				{
					"id": 700670113,
					"content": "我让小斯卡帕别抱了，赶紧带着人回主殿区域去。然后我就一个人过来找你们了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700670114
					],
					"speakerTitle": "维特鲁威"
				},
				{
					"id": 700670114,
					"content": "按理说，大家应该都在这附近吧。那她应该不会很远才对啊。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700670115
					],
					"speakerTitle": "维特鲁威"
				},
				{
					"id": 700670115,
					"content": "这是…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700670116
					],
					"speakerTitle": "彩特琳德"
				},
				{
					"id": 700670116,
					"content": "是一个紫水晶胸针。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700670117
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 700670117,
					"content": "是我手提箱里丢失的物件之一，是姐姐的东西。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700670118
					],
					"speakerTitle": "彩特琳德"
				},
				{
					"id": 700670118,
					"content": "原来是这样啊。太好了，这样就找到一件了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700670119
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 700670119,
					"content": "应该是被当作现在这个时代的展品文物被放到这里来了吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700670120
					],
					"speakerTitle": "维尼皮"
				},
				{
					"id": 700670120,
					"content": "其实，我思考墓志铭写什么，也是因为你姐姐问了一句。那个墓志铭我可没想几千年。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700670121
					],
					"speakerTitle": "维特鲁威"
				},
				{
					"id": 700670121,
					"content": "在这里不会死吗？那岂不是没办法写那种精妙绝伦的墓志铭了？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700670122
					],
					"speakerTitle": "劳姆希尔妲"
				},
				{
					"id": 700670122,
					"content": "按我的以前的地位，大概是可以埋进祭司们的公墓，与银白枝条同眠的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700670123
					],
					"speakerTitle": "维特鲁威"
				},
				{
					"id": 700670123,
					"content": "这是很高的荣誉，但确实没地方写墓志铭。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700670124
					],
					"speakerTitle": "维特鲁威"
				},
				{
					"id": 700670124,
					"content": "那我绝对不要这种荣誉。因为我已经写好墓志铭了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700670125
					],
					"speakerTitle": "劳姆希尔妲"
				},
				{
					"id": 700670125,
					"content": "那就是——",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700670126
					],
					"speakerTitle": "劳姆希尔妲"
				},
				{
					"id": 700670126,
					"content": "实在太谢谢你们了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700670127
					],
					"speakerTitle": "维尼皮"
				},
				{
					"id": 700670127,
					"content": "那你的赤王硬币？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700670128
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 700670128,
					"content": "你就这么惦记啊。等我念诵完一万次对赤王大人的忏罪经文就给你吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700670129
					],
					"speakerTitle": "维尼皮"
				},
				{
					"id": 700670129,
					"content": "这人听柯莎玛说赤王陨落的事情之后，又怒又哭。「你骗我！」",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700670137
					],
					"speakerTitle": "维特鲁威"
				},
				{
					"id": 700670137,
					"content": "「你骗我！骗子！不可能！」",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700670138
					],
					"speakerTitle": "维特鲁威"
				},
				{
					"id": 700670138,
					"content": "讲道理，我觉得比我墓志铭好笑。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700670130
					],
					"speakerTitle": "维特鲁威"
				},
				{
					"id": 700670130,
					"content": "算了算了。这么不情不愿的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700670131
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 700670131,
					"content": "哼，这个时候我们就要说，我们只是来帮彩特琳德找丢失的东西的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700670132
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 700670132,
					"content": "帮你们只是顺手哦！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700670133
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 700670133,
					"content": "#…谢谢你们，派蒙、{NICKNAME}。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700670134
					],
					"speakerTitle": "彩特琳德"
				},
				{
					"id": 700670134,
					"content": "唉，没有没有。毕竟也是因为我们你才被卷进这些怪事里的。我们只是在弥补过失。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700670135
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 700670135,
					"content": "毫不掩饰的差别对待啊。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700670136
					],
					"speakerTitle": "维尼皮"
				},
				{
					"id": 700670136,
					"content": "我的感谢是真心的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "彩特琳德"
				}
			]
		},
