				{
					"id": 700670302,
					"content": "在这里想自己墓志铭要写什么实在太奢侈了。可不怕你们笑话，我已经想好了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700670303
					],
					"speakerTitle": "维特鲁威"
				},
				{
					"id": 700670303,
					"content": "「请把我的爱转交给帕特拉卫城的——」",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700670304
					],
					"speakerTitle": "维特鲁威"
				},
				{
					"id": 700670304,
					"content": "维特鲁威！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700670305
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 700670305,
					"content": "没说完就沙化了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700670306
					],
					"speakerTitle": "彩特琳德"
				},
				{
					"id": 700670306,
					"content": "完了。我在这个悲伤的时刻很想笑。真不知道沙化解除之后他会不会害羞得想死。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700670307
					],
					"speakerTitle": "维尼皮"
				},
				{
					"id": 700670307,
					"content": "您真乐观。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700670308
					],
					"speakerTitle": "彩特琳德"
				},
				{
					"id": 700670308,
					"content": "现在是先处理那个守卫，还是争分夺秒搜索幸存者。我们要做出选择了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "维尼皮"
				}
			]
		},
		{
